      "id": "claim_a764a331149e408894e63d9b43fecd04",
      "statement": "Every matchmaking Server Action and lobby API route authorizes the caller by reading the wottle-playtest-session cookie via readLobbySession, which Zod-validates the decoded session and returns null on any missing or malformed value; the acting player is taken from session.player.id and never from client input.",
