      "statement": "persistLobbySession base64url-encodes the session and stores it in the wottle-playtest-session cookie as httpOnly, sameSite=lax, maxAge four hours, with the secure flag decided by shouldUseSecureCookies (env override, CI off-switch, else NODE_ENV).",
