    {
      "id": "claim_48dd6117c4c1421c8e8cbdfa32031dd0",
      "statement": "Lobby presence is authoritative in the lobby_presence table with an expires_at deadline set to PLAYTEST_PRESENCE_TTL_SECONDS (default 300s) at login and each heartbeat; the snapshot query only returns rows whose expires_at is still in the future, so missed heartbeats passively drop a player from the lobby.",
