      "statement": "The server-side presence cache is a process-global Map keyed by Symbol.for(wottle.presenceCache) whose entries expire after PLAYTEST_PRESENCE_CACHE_TTL_MS (default 300000ms) and are pruned lazily; fetchLobbySnapshot merges these cached players with the live DB rows, dedupes by id, and sorts by username.",
