      "statement": "orderDirectory pins the viewer first, then ranks other players by lobby status (available < matchmaking < in_match < offline), then by closeness of Elo rating to the viewer's (default 1200 when unrated), then by most-recently-seen, capping the visible list at LOBBY_DIRECTORY_CAP (24) and returning overflow as a separate hidden bucket.",
