      "id": "claim_227e0c751af94bf39b42a17eb8f7ec91",
      "statement": "startAutoQueue marks the player matchmaking, selects the least-recently-seen other matchmaking player, and atomically claims that opponent with a conditional status update (matchmaking to in_match); if the update matches zero rows another queuer won the race and the player stays queued, otherwise a match is bootstrapped.",
