      "statement": "bootstrapMatchRecord is the single chokepoint that creates a match: it upserts a matches row with a caller-supplied board_seed (a randomUUID making the board deterministic), player_a_id and player_b_id, round_limit defaulting to 10, optional rematch_of, and an initial state of pending, returning the new match id.",
